- 0x0: not divided
- 0x1: not divided
- 0x2: divided by 2
- 0x3: divided by 3 …
- 0xF: divided by 15 ssmod spread[8: 4]: SSMOD spread control
- 0: 0
- 1: 0.1%
- 2: 0.2%
- 3: 0.3%
- 4: 0.4%
- 5: 0.5%
- 6: 0.6%
- 7: 0.7% ...
