            desc = "Clock phase configuration. It is used for sample B clock debugging when the edge detection function is used.
- 0x00: 0°
- 0x01: 11.25°
- 0x02: 22.5° …
- 0x1E: 337.5°
- 0x1F: 348.75°

The default value is 90°, that is, 0x08.";
